---
source: tests/cli_usage.rs
expression: s.redact(&stdout)
---
Keyboard-first kanban with switch notes

Usage: brain-swap [OPTIONS] [COMMAND]

Commands:
  new        Create a card
  park       Append a switch note to a card
  context    Print the re-entry context of a session
  show       Print a card
  ls         List cards
  link       Link a session to a card
  move       Move a card to a column
  locate     Report where a card's pane is
  jump       Focus a card's pane
  templates  List card templates
  install    Install an adapter
  help       Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
      --board <BOARD>  Board for commands without a card ID (default: default_board)
      --json           Print one JSON object
  -h, --help           Print help
  -V, --version        Print version

Exit codes:
  0 success
  1 runtime error
  2 usage
  3 not found
  4 no reference
  5 busy
  6 jump not performed
